      "lines": [
        "在加热的期间，设酒精的密度变化很小. 于是，$\\Delta V$和$Q$",
        "的公式相除，则得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{\\Delta V}{Q}=\\frac{\\alpha}{\\rho c}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此得出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$Q=\\Delta V\\frac{\\rho c}{\\alpha}$； $Q=9600$焦耳."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 在地板和天花板之间竖直张紧一根长$l=3$米的钢",
        "弦. 当它降温$\\Delta t=30$°C时，弦的张力改变多少？已知在力$F$",
        "作用下弦的伸长量$\\Delta l$与这个力成正比，即$F=k\\Delta l$，式中$k=↵7\\times10^4$牛顿/米. 线胀系数$\\beta=1.1\\times10^{-5}$度$^{-1}$. 设固定点是",
        "不动的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解：假设弦没有固定，则降温以后，弦的长度为$l_1=l(1↵-\\beta\\Delta t)$，即缩短了$|\\Delta l|=|l_1-l|=l\\beta\\Delta t$. 如果现在给弦以",
        "拉力$F=k|\\Delta l|$，则弦伸长到原来的长度，此后，弦的两端可以",
        "固定在原先的固定点. 这样，力$F$是固定点对弦的作用力."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把所求得的$|\\Delta l|$值代到力$F$的公式中，则得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$F=k|\\Delta l|=kl\\beta\\Delta t$，",
        "$F\\approx70$牛顿."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
